### ─── PropertyLoop Vendor Jobs (Booking + Escrow) ───────────────────────────
### Login as buyer
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{buyerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{buyerPassword}}"
}

### Login as vendor
# @name loginVendor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{vendorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{vendorPassword}}"
}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### BOOKING FLOW (Buyer creates → Vendor accepts → works → completes → Buyer confirms)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 1. Buyer books a vendor service ═══
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": "{{loginVendor.response.body.user.id}}",
  "title": "Kitchen Sink Replacement",
  "description": "Replace kitchen sink and fix the drainage pipe underneath. Current sink is cracked.",
  "address": "12 Admiralty Way, Lekki Phase 1",
  "category": "Plumbing",
  "vendorFee": 45000,
  "scheduledFor": "2026-04-19T10:00:00.000Z",
  "clientName": "Tunde Akinola",
  "clientPhone": "+2348012345678",
  "clientEmail": "tunde.buyer@test.com",
  "paymentMethod": "card"
}

### ═══ 2. Verify escrow was set up correctly ═══
### Should show: escrowStatus=LOCKED, vendorFee=45000, platformFee=4500, escrowAmount=49500
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 3. Vendor lists pending jobs ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 4. Vendor accepts the job ═══
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 5. Vendor starts work ═══
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 6. Vendor marks complete with proof ═══
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completionNotes": "Replaced kitchen sink with stainless steel model. Fixed drainage pipe. All tested and working.",
  "completionProofImages": [
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585704032915-c3400ca199e7?w=600",
    "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584622781564-1d987f7333c1?w=600"
  ]
}

### ═══ 7. Buyer confirms completion → releases escrow ═══
### This should: status=PAID, escrowStatus=RELEASED, create VendorEarning, increment jobsCount
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{createBooking.response.body.id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 8. Buyer lists their bookings ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 9. Check vendor earnings ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor-earnings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 10. Check vendor earnings summary ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor-earnings/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### DISPUTE FLOW (separate booking)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 11. Create another booking ═══
# @name disputeBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": "{{loginVendor.response.body.user.id}}",
  "title": "Bathroom Pipe Repair",
  "description": "Leaking pipe in the bathroom ceiling",
  "address": "12 Admiralty Way, Lekki Phase 1",
  "vendorFee": 25000,
  "scheduledFor": "2026-04-20T14:00:00.000Z",
  "clientName": "Tunde Akinola",
  "clientPhone": "+2348012345678"
}

### ═══ 12. Fast-track to COMPLETED ═══
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{disputeBooking.response.body.id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{disputeBooking.response.body.id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{disputeBooking.response.body.id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completionNotes": "Pipe repaired"
}

### ═══ 13. Buyer disputes instead of confirming ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{disputeBooking.response.body.id}}/dispute
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "disputeReason": "The pipe is still leaking after the repair. Water dripping from the ceiling into the bathroom. Not fixed properly."
}

### ═══ 14. Verify: escrowStatus=DISPUTED, no new earning ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{disputeBooking.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### DECLINE FLOW
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ═══ 15. Create a booking to decline ═══
# @name declineBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": "{{loginVendor.response.body.user.id}}",
  "title": "Water Heater Installation",
  "description": "Install a new water heater in the guest bathroom",
  "address": "5 Bourdillon Road, Ikoyi",
  "vendorFee": 75000,
  "scheduledFor": "2026-04-25T09:00:00.000Z",
  "clientName": "Tunde Akinola",
  "clientPhone": "+2348012345678"
}

### ═══ 16. Vendor declines (deletes the job) ═══
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{declineBooking.response.body.id}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 17. Verify job is gone (expect 404) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor-jobs/{{declineBooking.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendor.response.body.accessToken}}
